10:Tc3e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』綺伝 いくさ世の徒花","description":"コロナ禍で制約を受けた「科白劇」を経て、本来想定されていた演出と構成でついに結実した「慶長熊本」の本公演。 西暦2205年。歌仙兼定率いる部隊に届いた、風雅な和歌に込められた入電。彼らが降り立った慶長元年の熊本は、弾圧を逃れたキリシタンたちが集い、歴史から切り離された「放棄された世界」と化していた。キリシタン大名や天正遣欧少年使節が割拠する異様な地で、刀剣男士たちは先行調査員・古今伝授の太刀と合流し、物語の中心にいる細川ガラシャの存在を知る。元主・細川忠興との邂逅、そして地蔵行平が抱える葛藤。洗練された美学の裏で、美しくも残酷な「徒花」たちが散りゆく運命を描く、祈りと矜持の物語。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-kiden","keywords":"刺さる/しんどい, 演出強め, セリフ重め, 和風モチーフ","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 琢磨","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-takuma"},{"@type":"Person","name":"梅津 瑞樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/umetsu-mizuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐野 真白","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sano-mashiro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松井 勇歩","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsui-yuho"},{"@type":"Person","name":"伊崎 龍次郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/izaki-ryujiro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"大見 拓土","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ohmi-takuto"},{"@type":"Person","name":"塚本 凌生","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/tsukamoto-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"星元 裕月","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hoshimoto-yuzuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"三浦 浩一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/miura-koichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"早乙女 じょうじ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/saotome-joji"},{"@type":"Person","name":"山浦 徹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yamaura-toru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"黒川 恭佑","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kurokawa-kyosuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"堀田 勝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hotta-masaru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"石原 正一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ishihara-shoichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"船木 政秀","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/funaki-masahide"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松村 龍之介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsumura-ryunosuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐藤 永典","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sato-hisanori"},{"@type":"Person","name":"深澤 大河","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/fukasawa-taiga"},{"@type":"Person","name":"湯本 健一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yumoto-kenichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"七海 ひろき","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/nanami-hiroki"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero-card stack-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Play Detail SSR"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"page-title","children":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』綺伝 いくさ世の徒花"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"lead","children":"コロナ禍で制約を受けた「科白劇」を経て、本来想定されていた演出と構成でついに結実した「慶長熊本」の本公演。\n西暦2205年。歌仙兼定率いる部隊に届いた、風雅な和歌に込められた入電。彼らが降り立った慶長元年の熊本は、弾圧を逃れたキリシタンたちが集い、歴史から切り離された「放棄された世界」と化していた。キリシタン大名や天正遣欧少年使節が割拠する異様な地で、刀剣男士たちは先行調査員・古今伝授の太刀と合流し、物語の中心にいる細川ガラシャの存在を知る。元主・細川忠興との邂逅、そして地蔵行平が抱える葛藤。洗練された美学の裏で、美しくも残酷な「徒花」たちが散りゆく運命を描く、祈りと矜持の物語。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pill-row","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"pill","href":"/series/butai-touken-ranbu","children":["シリーズ: ","舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）"]}],[["$","span","刺さる/しんどい",{"className":"pill","children":["#","刺さる/しんどい"]}],["$","span","演出強め",{"className":"pill","children":["#","演出強め"]}],["$","span","セリフ重め",{"className":"pill","children":["#","セリフ重め"]}],["$","span","和風モチーフ",{"className":"pill","children":["#","和風モチーフ"]}]],"$L11"]}]]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14"]}]]}]
